OL,3,GNEWSANew speed cameras go live on road
OL,4,Abetween towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew speed cameras have been installed
OL,7,Falong a major road between two towns in
OL,8,FDerbyshire.
OL,10,FTwo average speed cameras have gone
OL,11,Flive on the A5004 Long Hill between
OL,12,FBuxton and Whaley Bridge.
OL,14,FThe bright yellow cameras will enforce
OL,15,Fthe 40mph stretch of the road at
OL,16,FFernilee, said Derbyshire County
OL,17,FCouncil, between the former village
OL,18,Fhall and the Shady Oak pub.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
