OL,4,Abetween towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair are part of a network of seven
OL,7,Fcameras being installed through a #3.1m
OL,8,Fpackage of road safety improvements
OL,9,Ffunded by the Government's Safer Roads
OL,10,FFund.
